3. The empty box shows up in the final report, too
========================================================================
Coffee grinder   [0, 0, 1, 1, 2]
Electric kettle  [0, 1, 0, 2, 0]
Travel mug       [0, 0, 0, 0, 1]
Glass teapot     [0, 0, 0, 0, 0]
The zeroValue is the SAME value the business uses for 'no data yet':
the sign that aggregateByKey() is the right reducer.

